.TH DNSFILTER 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.6.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dnsfilter \- add reverse DNS names to input lines
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dnsfilter
.RB [ \-c " concurrency" ]
.RB [ \-l " lines" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads lines from standard input.  When a line begins with an IPv4 address,
performs a PTR lookup and inserts the result after that address.  Output order
is preserved.  Defaults are 10 concurrent lookups and batches of 1000 lines.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dnsname (1)
